# Implementation

- Make small, targeted changes. Do not build for hypothetical future needs.
- If something is unclear, ask before assuming.
- Use Linux commands only (this repo is developed on Linux).
- Put temporary tests in `tmp_tests/`. Create that directory when needed and remove it when finished.
- Prefer clear object-oriented design and shared reusable modules. No spaghetti; do not overcomplicate.
- Prefer a complete correct design now over incremental migration or backwards-compatibility shims.
